OLD_SECTION
(no file)

NEW_SECTION
Imports vUX-core.js only and drives every section. Commented as documentation, mainly at
the sharp edges: animate()'s value is a delta that is remembered per element, flip.card()
is set up by its first call, slide options are written into by the core so each call gets
a fresh object, dimension defaults apply when a key is missing, makeActive needs its
parent, the filter pulse leaves a transition behind, scroll.y needs its argument,
attachEventHandler only tests e.target, and getTimeSegments warns for a past time.

REASON
The page is how the core is evaluated, and main.js is meant to be read. The bad-input and
known-defects buttons make the real calls and print what is thrown, so the page shows
the current behaviour, not a description of it.
